#: src/prefs.js:62 src/prefs.js:94
msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

#: src/prefs.js:91
msgid "Press the keys…"
msgstr "キーを押してください…"

#: src/prefs.js:127
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/prefs.js:130
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: src/prefs.js:131
msgid "Connect to Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code に接続"

#: src/prefs.js:132
msgid ""
"When Claude is done or asks you something, you get a notification and its "
"turned off screen lights up. No account needed."
msgstr ""
"Claude が終わったり何か聞いてきたりすると、通知が届き、オフにした画面が点灯し"
"ます。アカウントは不要です。"

#: src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Connected"
msgstr "接続済み"

#: src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "未接続"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "切断"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "接続"

#: src/prefs.js:149
#, javascript-format
msgid "Could not change %s: %s"
msgstr "%s を変更できませんでした: %s"

#: src/prefs.js:154
msgid "When Claude is done"
msgstr "Claude が終わったとき"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "When Claude waits for you"
msgstr "Claude が待っているとき"

#: src/prefs.js:155
msgid "A permission or a question"
msgstr "許可または質問"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Also a notification"
msgstr "通知も出す"

#: src/prefs.js:156
msgid "Click it to go to the terminal"
msgstr "クリックでターミナルへ"

#: src/prefs.js:157
msgid "Other programs too"
msgstr "ほかのプログラムも"

#: src/prefs.js:158
msgid ""
"Terminal bell or an app asking for attention, e.g. make ; printf \"\\a\""
msgstr "ターミナルのベルや注意を求めるアプリ（例: make ; printf \"\\a\"）"

#: src/prefs.js:163
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "スライダー"

#: src/prefs.js:164
msgid ""
"Every monitor gets its own slider in Quick Settings, next to the volume "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"各モニターにクイック設定の音量スライダーの隣に専用スライダーが付きます。"

#: src/prefs.js:166
msgid "Monitor menu"
msgstr "モニターメニュー"

#: src/prefs.js:167
msgid "Simple (recommended)"
msgstr "シンプル（おすすめ）"

#: src/prefs.js:168
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "詳細"

#: src/prefs.js:169
msgid ""
"Simple: one slider for the value you pick. Detailed: a slider for every "
"value."
msgstr "シンプル：選んだ値のスライダーが 1 つ。詳細：値ごとにスライダー。"

#: src/prefs.js:170
msgid "Left of the slider"
msgstr "スライダーの左側"

#: src/prefs.js:171
msgid "Brightness icon"
msgstr "明るさアイコン"

#: src/prefs.js:172
msgid "Monitor number (1, 2, 3…)"
msgstr "モニター番号 (1, 2, 3…)"

#: src/prefs.js:173
msgid "Short name (LG, VS…)"
msgstr "短い名前 (LG, VS…)"

#: src/prefs.js:175
msgid "Show the monitor name on hover"
msgstr "ホバー時にモニター名を表示"

#: src/prefs.js:176
msgid "Replace GNOME’s own brightness slider"
msgstr "GNOME 標準の明るさスライダーを置き換える"

#: src/prefs.js:177
msgid "The laptop screen then gets a row like the other monitors"
msgstr "ノートPCの画面も他のモニターと同じように行が付きます"

#: src/prefs.js:180
msgid "Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モード"

#: src/prefs.js:181
msgid "Add a menu to the Night Light button"
msgstr "夜間モードボタンにメニューを追加"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Temperature, red screen and its strength"
msgstr "色温度、赤い画面とその強さ"

#: src/prefs.js:188
msgid "Evening"
msgstr "夕方"

#: src/prefs.js:191 src/lib/ui.js:1287
msgid "Automatic dimming"
msgstr "自動減光"

#: src/prefs.js:192
msgid ""
"Turn it on per monitor with the moon button next to its slider. The monitor "
"slowly gets darker and warmer in the evening and comes back in the morning."
msgstr ""
"各モニターのスライダー横の月ボタンでオンにします。夕方にモニターがゆっくり暗"
"く暖かくなり、朝に元に戻ります。"

#: src/prefs.js:194 src/lib/ui.js:1305
msgid "Start"
msgstr "開始"

#: src/prefs.js:195
msgid "At sunset"
msgstr "日没時"

#: src/prefs.js:196
msgid "At a fixed time"
msgstr "固定時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Morning transition"
msgstr "朝の切り替え"

#: src/prefs.js:198
msgid "Minutes"
msgstr "分"

#: src/prefs.js:199 src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Morning"
msgstr "朝"

#: src/prefs.js:199
msgid "Minutes after sunrise"
msgstr "日の出後の分数"

#: src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Brightness comes back at"
msgstr "明るさが戻る時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:206
msgid "For new monitors"
msgstr "新しいモニターの既定値"

#: src/prefs.js:207
msgid ""
"For the main monitor. The others take 30 minutes longer and go down to 0 %, "
"with a little extra dimming late at night. Each monitor can change these in "
"its own menu."
msgstr ""
"メインモニター用です。ほかのモニターは 30 分長く、0 % まで下がり、深夜には少"
"し追加の減光も入ります。各モニターのメニューで変更できます。"

#: src/prefs.js:209
msgid "Minutes after sunset"
msgstr "日没後の分数"

#: src/prefs.js:210
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "開始時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:213 src/lib/ui.js:1310
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "時間"

#: src/prefs.js:213
msgid "Minutes the evening dimming takes"
msgstr "夕方の減光にかかる分数"

#: src/prefs.js:215 src/lib/ui.js:37
msgid "Night brightness"
msgstr "夜間の明るさ"

#: src/prefs.js:215
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "パーセント"

#: src/prefs.js:224 src/prefs.js:227
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/prefs.js:225
msgid ""
"Only used to calculate sunset and sunrise. Automatic uses the location GNOME "
"keeps for Night Light, otherwise your time zone. Nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"日没と日の出の計算にのみ使用します。自動: GNOME が夜間モード用に保持している"
"位置、なければタイムゾーン。何も送信されません。"

#: src/prefs.js:228
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動"

#: src/prefs.js:229
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: src/prefs.js:231
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "緯度"

#: src/prefs.js:232
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "経度"

#: src/prefs.js:235
msgid "Today"
msgstr "今日"

#: src/prefs.js:252
msgid "manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: src/prefs.js:253
msgid "GNOME location"
msgstr "GNOME の位置"

#: src/prefs.js:254
#, javascript-format
msgid "time zone %s"
msgstr "タイムゾーン %s"

#: src/prefs.js:255
msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "UTC オフセット"

#: src/prefs.js:258
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s · sunrise %s · from %s"
msgstr "日没 %s · 日の出 %s · %s より"

#: src/prefs.js:266
msgid "Screen off"
msgstr "画面オフ"

#: src/prefs.js:269
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "ボタン"

#: src/prefs.js:270
msgid "In each monitor’s menu (the moon button)."
msgstr "各モニターのメニュー内（月ボタン）。"

#: src/prefs.js:272
msgid "Place"
msgstr "場所"

#: src/prefs.js:273
msgid "At the bottom, large"
msgstr "下に大きく"

#: src/prefs.js:274
msgid "At the top, large"
msgstr "上に大きく"

#: src/prefs.js:275
msgid "Next to the monitor name, small"
msgstr "モニター名の横に小さく"

#: src/prefs.js:277 src/lib/ui.js:339 src/lib/ui.js:1620 src/lib/ui.js:1691
msgid "Lowest light"
msgstr "最小の明るさ"

#: src/prefs.js:278
msgid "Brightness 0 and full extra dimming; press again to go back"
msgstr "明るさ 0 と最大の追加減光。もう一度押すと元に戻ります"

#: src/prefs.js:279 src/prefs.js:285 src/lib/offmenu.js:48 src/lib/ui.js:340
#: src/lib/ui.js:1623
msgid "Turn off screen"
msgstr "画面をオフ"

#: src/prefs.js:280 src/lib/offmenu.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:341 src/lib/ui.js:1634
msgid "Turn off other screens"
msgstr "ほかの画面をオフ"

#: src/prefs.js:281
msgid "Press again to turn them back on"
msgstr "もう一度押すと再びオンになります"

#: src/prefs.js:286
msgid "“Turn off screen” and “Turn off other screens” in each monitor’s menu."
msgstr "各モニターのメニューにある「画面をオフ」と「ほかの画面をオフ」。"

#: src/prefs.js:288
msgid "Light up while the mouse is on it"
msgstr "マウスが上にある間は点灯"

#: src/prefs.js:289
msgid ""
"A turned off screen lights up while the mouse is on it and goes dark again "
"when the mouse leaves. The same button turns it back on."
msgstr ""
"オフにした画面はマウスが上にある間だけ点灯し、離れると再び暗くなります。同じ"
"ボタンで元に戻せます。"

#: src/prefs.js:294
msgid "A turned off screen"
msgstr "オフにした画面"

#: src/prefs.js:295
msgid ""
"Clicks and typing always reach the apps on it. Its options are in the "
"monitor’s menu (the moon button) and behind the small dot."
msgstr ""
"クリックや入力は常にその画面のアプリに届きます。オプションはモニターのメ"
"ニュー（月ボタン）と小さな点にあります。"

#: src/prefs.js:297
msgid "Small dot in a corner"
msgstr "角の小さな点"

#: src/prefs.js:298
msgid "Click it for the screen’s menu; drag it to another corner"
msgstr "クリック: 画面のメニュー、ドラッグ: 別の角へ"

#: src/prefs.js:299
msgid "Keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "キーボードショートカット"

#: src/prefs.js:300
msgid "The menu of the screen under the mouse"
msgstr "マウスがある画面のメニュー"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "“Keep lit” lasts"
msgstr "「点灯したまま」の時間"

#: src/prefs.js:301
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "秒"

#: src/prefs.js:305 src/lib/ui.js:1836 src/lib/ui.js:1911
msgid "Red screen"
msgstr "赤い画面"

#: src/prefs.js:306
msgid ""
"Switch it on in the Night Light menu. It removes all blue and green light, "
"which helps you fall asleep."
msgstr "夜間モードのメニューでオン。青と緑の光をすべて除き、眠りやすくします。"

#: src/prefs.js:308
msgid "Only while Night Light is active"
msgstr "夜間モード有効時のみ"

#: src/prefs.js:309
msgid "Starts and stops together with Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モードと一緒に開始・終了"

#: src/prefs.js:310 src/lib/ui.js:1852
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "強さ"

#: src/prefs.js:324
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "詳細"

#: src/prefs.js:328
msgid ""
"External monitors are controlled over DDC/CI. Your user needs access to /dev/"
"i2c-* (usually the “i2c” group)."
msgstr ""
"外部モニターは DDC/CI で制御します。/dev/i2c-* へのアクセス権 (通常は「i2c」"
"グループ) が必要です。"

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil found"
msgstr "ddcutil が見つかりました"

#: src/prefs.js:332
msgid "ddcutil not found"
msgstr "ddcutil が見つかりません"

#: src/prefs.js:333
msgid "Install ddcutil from your distribution, then press Scan again"
msgstr ""
"ディストリビューションから ddcutil をインストールし、「再スキャン」を押してく"
"ださい"

#: src/prefs.js:335
msgid "Scan again"
msgstr "再スキャン"

#: src/prefs.js:340
msgid "ddcutil program"
msgstr "ddcutil プログラム"

#: src/prefs.js:343
msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "追加の引数"

#: src/prefs.js:346
msgid "Pause between writes"
msgstr "書き込み間隔"

#: src/prefs.js:347
msgid "Milliseconds. Raise it if a monitor misses changes"
msgstr "ミリ秒。モニターが変更を取りこぼす場合は増やしてください"

#: src/prefs.js:351
msgid "Debug messages"
msgstr "デバッグメッセージ"

#: src/prefs.js:351
msgid "Written to the system journal"
msgstr "システムジャーナルに書き込まれます"

#: src/lib/cornerdot.js:61
msgid "Screen menu"
msgstr "画面メニュー"

#: src/lib/displays.js:59
msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "モニター"

#: src/lib/displays.js:415
msgid "Built-in Display"
msgstr "内蔵ディスプレイ"

#: src/lib/displays.js:416
msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "内蔵"

#: src/lib/displays.js:418
#, javascript-format
msgid "Monitor %d"
msgstr "モニター %d"

#: src/lib/notify.js:115
msgid "Claude is waiting for you"
msgstr "Claude が待っています"

#: src/lib/notify.js:115
msgid "Claude is done"
msgstr "Claude が終わりました"

#: src/lib/notify.js:129
msgid "Go to the terminal"
msgstr "ターミナルへ"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:15
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d s"
msgstr "%d 秒"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:17
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d min %d s"
msgstr "%d 分 %d 秒"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:17 src/lib/ui.js:62
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d 分"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:43
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit · %s"
msgstr "点灯したまま · %s"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:44
msgid "Keep lit until I darken it"
msgstr "暗くするまで点灯したまま"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:45
msgid "Darken now"
msgstr "今すぐ暗く"

#: src/lib/offmenu.js:46
msgid "Turn the screen back on"
msgstr "画面を元に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:36
msgid "Day brightness"
msgstr "昼の明るさ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:38
msgid "Extra dimming"
msgstr "追加の減光"

#: src/lib/ui.js:39
msgid ""
"Darkens the picture further when the monitor is already at its lowest "
"brightness."
msgstr "モニターがすでに最低の明るさのとき、画面をさらに暗くします。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:45
msgid "Night light"
msgstr "夜間モード"

#: src/lib/ui.js:46 src/lib/ui.js:1824
msgid ""
"Blue light in the evening holds back melatonin, the sleep hormone. A warmer "
"screen helps you fall asleep more easily."
msgstr ""
"夜の青い光は睡眠ホルモンのメラトニンを抑えます。暖かい画面は寝つきを良くしま"
"す。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:47
msgid ""
"How strong Night Light is on this monitor. ×1 = exactly GNOME’s Night Light, "
"nothing added. ×0 turns it off here, ×2 makes it twice as warm."
msgstr ""
"このモニターでの夜間モードの強さ。×1 = GNOME の夜間モードそのまま、何も足しま"
"せん。×0 でここだけオフ、×2 で 2 倍暖かく。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:48
msgid "Red light"
msgstr "赤い光"

#: src/lib/ui.js:49 src/lib/ui.js:1841
msgid ""
"Red light disturbs melatonin and your body clock the least of all colours. "
"Ideal for the last hours before bed."
msgstr ""
"赤い光は、すべての色の中でメラトニンと体内時計への影響が最も少ない色です。寝"
"る前の数時間に最適です。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:50
msgid ""
"How strong the red screen is on this monitor. ×1 = the red screen as set in "
"the Night Light menu, nothing added. ×0 keeps this monitor normal, ×2 makes "
"it twice as red."
msgstr ""
"このモニターでの赤い画面の強さ。×1 = 夜間モードのメニューで設定した赤い画面の"
"まま、何も足しません。×0 で通常のまま、×2 で 2 倍赤く。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:63
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h %d min"
msgstr "%d 時間 %d 分"

#: src/lib/ui.js:63
#, javascript-format
msgid "%d h"
msgstr "%d 時間"

#: src/lib/ui.js:284
msgid "Earlier"
msgstr "早く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:287
msgid "Later"
msgstr "遅く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1080
msgid "Automatic dimming and more"
msgstr "自動減光など"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1249
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1293
msgid ""
"Slowly dims this monitor in the evening, and brings it back in the morning."
msgstr "夕方にこのモニターをゆっくり暗くし、朝に元に戻します。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1294
msgid ""
"Drag the points to shape the evening; the big point also sets how long it "
"takes. + adds a button that runs by itself."
msgstr ""
"点をドラッグして夕方の形を決めます。大きな点で長さも決まります。+ で自動で動"
"くボタンを追加。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1311
msgid "Shorter"
msgstr "短く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1312
msgid "Longer"
msgstr "長く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1322
msgid "Back to normal in the morning"
msgstr "朝に元に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1326
msgid ""
"When the morning comes, lowest light and turned off screens go back to "
"normal, whether they were switched on by hand or by the graph."
msgstr ""
"朝になると、最小の明るさとオフにした画面が元に戻ります。手動でも、グラフから"
"入れたものでも同じです。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1359
msgid "Back to 100 %"
msgstr "100 % に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1362 src/lib/ui.js:1364
msgid "Back to the default evening curve"
msgstr "既定の夕方カーブに戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1380
msgid "Back to the default: ×1 and GNOME’s automatic time (sunset)"
msgstr "既定に戻す：×1 と GNOME の自動時刻（日没）"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1385
msgid "Back to ×1"
msgstr "×1 に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Day"
msgstr "昼"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Night"
msgstr "夜"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1403
msgid "Extra"
msgstr "追加"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1404
msgid "Warmth"
msgstr "暖かさ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1404
msgid "Red"
msgstr "赤"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1436 src/lib/ui.js:1585 src/lib/ui.js:1854
msgid "Back to the default"
msgstr "既定に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1541
msgid "While the screen is off"
msgstr "画面がオフの間"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1581
msgid "Dark while off"
msgstr "オフのときの暗さ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1582
msgid ""
"While the screen is off, the monitor stays at its lowest light and this much "
"black is added on top. 25 % = a little darker, 100 % = fully black."
msgstr ""
"画面がオフの間、モニターは最低の明るさのままで、その上にこの量の黒を重ねま"
"す。25 % = 少し暗く、100 % = 真っ黒。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1602
#, javascript-format
msgid "Keep lit for %s"
msgstr "%s 点灯したまま"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1603
#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"On: after the mouse leaves, the screen stays lit for %s, then goes dark. "
"Off: it goes dark as soon as the mouse leaves."
msgstr ""
"オン：マウスが離れた後も %s 点灯し、その後暗くなります。オフ：マウスが離れる"
"とすぐ暗くなります。"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1687
#, javascript-format
msgid "Brightness %s"
msgstr "明るさ %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1689
msgid "Turned off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1709
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s %s %d min"
msgstr "日没 %s %s %d 分"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1712
msgid "Fixed time"
msgstr "固定時刻"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1715
#, javascript-format
msgid "Until %s"
msgstr "%s まで"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1724
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1822
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "色温度"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1825
msgid "Back to GNOME’s default"
msgstr "GNOME の既定に戻す"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1919
msgid "Sunset to sunrise"
msgstr "日没から日の出まで"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1941
msgid "Turns on together with Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モードと一緒にオン"

#: src/lib/ui.js:1943
msgid "Starts when Night Light starts"
msgstr "夜間モード開始時に開始"
